# Runtime state, not fixture data. Gate check 4 mutates what node-el exports by
# writing mutator.yaml here, and this directory is bind-mounted read-write into
# the container so that write lands in the working tree. Ignoring it keeps
# `git status` clean after a gate run.
#
# Scoped to this file rather than added to the root .gitignore, which carries a
# deliberately unstaged edit that must not be disturbed.
/mutator.yaml
